g",{"ruta":71},"/carlos3/img/911_gallery.png",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":57,"description":74},"text","I wanted to create a website that not only showcased the design and performance of the Porsche 911, but also captured the emotional connection that many people have with this iconic sports car.",{"id":76,"comp_type":77,"comp_var":78,"imgs":79},"grid2","grid","triple",[80,83,86],{"ruta":81,"alt":82},"/carlos3/img/911_intro.png","The Soul of the 911 — intro section",{"ruta":84,"alt":85},"/carlos3/img/911_oghero.png","The Soul of the 911 — hero section",{"ruta":87,"alt":88},"/carlos3/img/911_evo-mb.png","Porsche 911 evolution on mobile",{"comp_type":90,"comp_var":91,"link":92,"description":93,"imgs":94},"related","project","/projects/kora","Kora Living",[95],{"ruta":96,"alt":97},"/carlos3/img/kora.jpg","",true,"/projects/911",{},"projects/911","cCQhCDXjqrs7K_Tkuk1yCQuOv-H5LpKYsFQSglS9wrw",{"id":104,"title":105,"body":7,"description":7,"extension":8,"meta":106,"navigation":98,"path":163,"seo":164,"stem":165,"__hash__":166},"projects/projects/aps.json","Aps",{"order":107,"name":108,"year":109,"thumb":110,"slug":111,"relacionados":112},5,"APS Racing","2024","/carlos3/img/aps.png","/aps",{"1":113},[114,128,133,136,145,147,157],{"comp_type":18,"comp_var":19,"class":20,"html":115,"imgs":118,"cards":121},[116],{"title":108,"description":117},"APS is a rally website that offers industry content in different formats such as videos, photographs, and news. For this project, I was responsible for the website design, as well as the front-end and back-end development.",[119],{"ruta":110,"alt":120},"APS Racing — project hero image",[122,124,125,127],{"text":123,"class":31},"Madrid",{"text":33,"class":34},{"text":126,"class":37},"Media",{"text":109,"class":39},{"comp_type":42,"comp_var":43,"imgs":129},[130],{"ruta":131,"alt":132},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734252818/aps_hero-ipad-min_u6hyt2.png","APS Racing website on iPad",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":134,"description":135},"Left","One of the main challenges of this project was to create a design that could adapt to the different types of content and formats, while maintaining a consistent and visually appealing aesthetic.",{"comp_type":56,"comp_var":57,"content":137},{"imgs":138},[139,141,143],{"ruta":140},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732379999/aps_news-ipad_vedumr_c_crop_ar_4_3_tiqphp.png",{"ruta":142},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732380000/aps_media-laptop_hpuvmj_c_crop_ar_4_3_pag80n.png",{"ruta":144},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732379600/aps_video-ipad_ytbdny.png",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":57,"description":146},"The website features a clean and modern design, with a focus on high-quality visuals and easy navigation. The use of a grid layout allows for a flexible and dynamic presentation of the content, while the use of bold typography and black and white colors helps to create a strong visual identity for the brand.",{"id":148,"comp_type":77,"comp_var":149,"imgs":150},"grid1","double",[151,154],{"ruta":152,"alt":153},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732380000/aps_hero-iphone_bza34x_c_crop_ar_3_4_ihlixd.png","APS Racing hero section on iPhone",{"ruta":155,"alt":156},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732379602/aps_video-iphone_csmewp.png","APS Racing video section on iPhone",{"comp_type":90,"comp_var":91,"link":158,"description":159,"imgs":160},"/projects/la-bamba","La Bamba Eventos",[161],{"ruta":162,"alt":97},"/carlos3/img/bamba.jpg","/projects/aps",{},"projects/aps","SFymwBJG-LKYuT7VCo43aglRTofhlSkEYLk7_KDKXlM",{"id":168,"title":169,"body":7,"description":7,"extension":8,"meta":170,"navigation":98,"path":222,"seo":223,"stem":224,"__hash__":225},"projects/projects/bat.json","Bat",{"order":171,"name":172,"year":109,"thumb":173,"slug":174,"relacionados":175},4,"Bat Architecture","/carlos3/img/bat.jpg","/bat",{"1":176},[177,191,196,198,206,208,219],{"comp_type":18,"comp_var":19,"class":20,"html":178,"imgs":181,"cards":184,"link":190},[179],{"title":172,"description":180},"Bat Architecture is the corporate website of Bat, an architecture firm based in Bilbao. The site serves as a showcase for the company's portfolio of projects, providing information about the firm's design philosophy and approach to architecture.",[182],{"ruta":173,"alt":183},"Bat Architecture — project hero image",[185,186,187,189],{"text":30,"class":31},{"text":33,"class":34},{"text":188,"class":37},"Corporate web",{"text":109,"class":39},"https://bat.archi/",{"comp_type":42,"comp_var":43,"imgs":192},[193],{"ruta":194,"alt":195},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734258972/bat-projects-desktop-min_pgg4tt.png","Bat Architecture projects listing on desktop",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":134,"description":197},"I worked on this project while working at \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zorraquino.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Zorraquino\u003C/a>, a design studio with a multidisciplinary team, in collaboration with \u003Ca href=\"https://banila.studio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Banila studio\u003C/a>, a top-notch design agency. As a front-end developer, I was responsible for implementing the design and functionality of the website.",{"id":148,"comp_type":77,"comp_var":149,"imgs":199},[200,203],{"ruta":201,"alt":202},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734258971/bat-home-desktop-min_lzglky.png","Bat Architecture homepage on desktop",{"ruta":204,"alt":205},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734258979/bat-project-desktop_t6vhst.png","Bat Architecture project detail on desktop",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":57,"description":207},"The pages unfold with a smooth and elegant animation, creating a dynamic and engaging user experience. The design of the website is clean and modern, with a focus on showcasing the company's portfolio of projects in an attractive and visually appealing way.",{"id":76,"comp_type":77,"comp_var":78,"imgs":209},[210,213,216],{"ruta":211,"alt":212},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734258979/bat-contact-desktop_wc950j.png","Bat Architecture contact page on desktop",{"ruta":214,"alt":215},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734258977/bat-layout-desktop_inrgwz.png","Bat Architecture layout overview on desktop",{"ruta":217,"alt":218},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734258976/bat-project-mobile_v9ebj2.png","Bat Architecture project detail on mobile",{"comp_type":90,"comp_var":91,"link":163,"description":108,"imgs":220},[221],{"ruta":110,"alt":97},"/projects/bat",{},"projects/bat","iuW3HfMjy1NmqcXmdr8mj0S1xL1aebWHijkmzMw_bUI",{"id":227,"title":228,"body":7,"description":7,"extension":8,"meta":229,"navigation":98,"path":92,"seo":282,"stem":283,"__hash__":284},"projects/projects/kora.json","Kora",{"order":230,"name":93,"year":231,"thumb":96,"slug":232,"relacionados":233},2,"2025","/kora",{"1":234},[235,249,254,256,264,266,276],{"comp_type":18,"comp_var":19,"class":20,"html":236,"imgs":239,"cards":242,"link":248},[237],{"title":93,"description":238},"Kora Living is a hospitality group with properties across Spain. I work in-house as the developer behind their digital ecosystem — koraliving.com, the individual resort sites, and Kategora's digital products — building on the foundation laid by \u003Ca href=\"https://www.somoscuchillo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cuchillo\u003C/a>.",[240],{"ruta":96,"alt":241},"Kora Living — project hero image",[243,244,245,247],{"text":30,"class":31},{"text":33,"class":34},{"text":246,"class":37},"Hospitality",{"text":231,"class":39},"https://koraliving.com/",{"comp_type":42,"comp_var":43,"imgs":250},[251],{"ruta":252,"alt":253},"/carlos3/img/kora_greencity.webp","Kora green city landing page",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":134,"description":255},"Each property has its own site with its own needs. My job is to keep them coherent — same quality, same feel — while moving fast enough to ship new features and react to what the business requires.",{"id":148,"comp_type":77,"comp_var":149,"imgs":257},[258,261],{"ruta":259,"alt":260},"/carlos3/img/kora_team.png","Kora Living team page",{"ruta":262,"alt":263},"/carlos3/img/kora_talent.webp","Kora Living talent page",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":57,"description":265},"\u003Ca href=\"https://www.somoscuchillo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cuchillo\u003C/a> set a high visual bar. The work since then has been about meeting it every time something new gets built — new sections, new interactions, new integrations — without letting the experience slip.",{"id":76,"comp_type":77,"comp_var":78,"imgs":267},[268,271,273],{"ruta":269,"alt":270},"/carlos3/img/kora_urban.webp","Kora talent oportunities page",{"ruta":272,"alt":85},"/carlos3/img/kora_oportunities.webp",{"ruta":274,"alt":275},"/carlos3/img/kora_olea.webp","Kora Olea mobile footer",{"comp_type":90,"comp_var":91,"link":277,"description":278,"imgs":279},"/projects/overshoot","The Overshoot",[280],{"ruta":281,"alt":97},"/carlos3/img/overshoot.png",{},"projects/kora","xloXg136cQMKRUF5HbGzRdi0jLYqICg_Cl3cQaQ6f_0",{"id":286,"title":287,"body":7,"description":7,"extension":8,"meta":288,"navigation":98,"path":158,"seo":341,"stem":342,"__hash__":343},"projects/projects/la-bamba.json","La Bamba",{"order":289,"name":290,"year":109,"thumb":162,"slug":291,"relacionados":292},6,"La bamba","/la-bamba",{"1":293},[294,307,312,314,322,324,335],{"comp_type":18,"comp_var":19,"class":20,"html":295,"imgs":298,"cards":301},[296],{"title":159,"description":297},"La Bamba is a website that I designed and developed for a company that organizes events in Madrid. The site provides information about the different shows organized by the company, including details about the location, date, and artists performing at each occasion.",[299],{"ruta":162,"alt":300},"La Bamba Eventos — project hero image",[302,303,304,306],{"text":123,"class":31},{"text":33,"class":34},{"text":305,"class":37},"Events",{"text":109,"class":39},{"comp_type":42,"comp_var":43,"imgs":308},[309],{"ruta":310,"alt":311},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732380818/bamba_list-iphone_dlo7fw_c_crop_ar_3_4_zy6t5p.png","La Bamba events listing on iPhone",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":134,"description":313},"The company wanted a website that was easy to update, visually appealing, and user-friendly, so I designed a clean, modern site with strong visuals and simple navigation.",{"id":148,"comp_type":77,"comp_var":149,"imgs":315},[316,319],{"ruta":317,"alt":318},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732380770/bamba_locations-iphone_ofnjan.png","La Bamba locations on iPhone",{"ruta":320,"alt":321},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734252817/bamba_locations-laptop-min_feddil.png","La Bamba locations on laptop",{"comp_type":73,"comp_var":57,"description":323},"Basing the design on a clean and modern aesthetic, I created a visually striking website that effectively communicates the energy and excitement of the events organized by La Bamba.",{"id":76,"comp_type":77,"comp_var":78,"imgs":325},[326,329,332],{"ruta":327,"alt":328},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732380965/bamba_djs-laptop_znrkj8_c_crop_ar_4_3_uphlnr.png","La Bamba DJs section on laptop",{"ruta":330,"alt":331},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1734252817/bamba_hero-laptop-min_s25zrb.png","La Bamba homepage on laptop",{"ruta":333,"alt":334},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732380964/bamba_hero-iphone_uyjgp1_c_crop_ar_3_4_hedh0x.png","La Bamba homepage on iPhone",{"comp_type":90,"comp_var":91,"link":336,"description":337,"imgs":338},"/projects/oir10","Oir 10",[339],{"ruta":340,"alt":97},"/carlos3/img/manos.jpg",{},"projects/la-bamba","cqSWf1DjxLZemLoHWsY_sZlLltGczpqDrc9OL8nLFgU",{"id":345,"title":346,"body":7,"description":7,"extension":8,